      "source": "https://www.onlyinonslow.com/towns/richlands/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town opened its own library and museum in 1880, making it the first in Onslow County to host such institutions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
