    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Onslow County Museum in Richlands showcases artifacts from the county’s earliest settlement to today, blending old and new.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.onlyinonslow.com/towns/richlands/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Richlands hosts the annual Farmer's Day festival, a celebration of its agrarian heritage that ran from 1966 to 2016.",
